{"job_id":"F-ce2eb32ef2929a00643a","family_id":"F-ce2eb32ef2929a00643a","title":"중국ㆍ인도네시아 및 대만산 스테인리스강 평판압연에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":47,"target_id":"657b071a0f9d828d280534985b006e3d6d89464e69309ce085a442e48fc6d44b","source_hash":"23bb50b1ebe4610cf065549bba2a8c501b92b37d1edc752aa9977bfa2ac6946b","text":"关于对来自中国、印度尼西亚和台湾的扁平轧制不锈钢征收反倾销税的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"5821df9c440bd9cc863aab3145095876d9c104e72397826703cad7f1d5fca0b8","source_hash":"1a2180cc6d0a23473176e09b095aee2b985442fe6d501f1561d90af9fc54684e","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":1019,"target_id":"c0dfd15bb37a19a5bc56f1092ce2dc779d7c43e839f2a71187f2b20afd9ce3bd","source_hash":"ac54b15c79e82d2a15192623bdbae609ad5fb7684494753c5ecc062730736ab2","text":"第二条（征税对象） 应征收反倾销税的商品为产自中国、印度尼西亚和台湾的扁轧不锈钢（根据《海关法实施令》第九十八条第一款，海关和统计协调制度商品编码为：7219.12.1010、7219.12.1090、7219.12.9000、7219.13.1010、7219.13.1090、7219.13.9000、7219.14.1010、7219.14.1090、7219.14.9000、7219.22.1010、7219.23.1090、7219.24.1090、7219.25.1090、7219.26.1090、7219.27.1090、7219.28.1090、7219.28.1090、7219.29.1090、7219.28.1090、7219.29.1090、7219.29.1090、7219.22.1010、7219.29.109 ... 7219.22.1090、号 7219.22.9000、号 7219.23.1010、号 7219.23.1090、号 7219.23.9000、号 7219.24.1010、号 7219.24.1090、号7219.24.9000、7219.31.1010 号、7219.31.1090 号、7219.31.9000 号、7219.32.1010 号、7219.32.1090 号、7219.32.9000 号、 7219.33.1010，号7219.33.1090、7219.33.9000 号、7219.34.1010 号、7219.34.1090 号、7219.34.9000 号、7219.35.1010 号、7219.35.1090 号、 7219.35.9000、7219.90.1010 号、7219.90.1090 号、7219.90.9000 号、7220.11.1010 号、7220.11.1090 号、7220.11.9000 号、 7220.12.1010，号7220.12.1090、7220.12.9000（指与税号7220.20.1010、7220.20.1090、7220.20.9000、7220.90.1010、7220.90.1090或7220.90.9000对应的物项），且厚度为8毫米（mm）或以下。但附件1所列物项除外。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1019,"end":1241,"target_id":"eef5a96976d9486e91ecd3735a7fb0502f7e52f36e728910795988a416c7c63d","source_hash":"724aa6ab567e07096c0390840ab6cf02457ab05572f2ca028f0d329d246091ea","text":"第3条（受征税约束的供应商）\n① 受反倾销税约束的供应商，是指根据第二条正文规定应征收反倾销税的货物的供应商。\n② 尽管有第1款的规定，附件2所列供应商如已根据《海关法》第54条第1款的规定接受财政经济大臣作出的价格调整承诺，则不属于第1款规定的应税供应商之列。但是，如该等价格调整承诺未履行，则应征收反倾销税。<2026年1月2日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1241,"end":1329,"target_id":"adf775ff827151653d00eec253d69730acc90ac32a298c400d4c6f70b7c50df7","source_hash":"258cb84107757a89e4c56317a84843e0fc80341d91ff280ab4073961bc0aa5a1","text":"第四条（反倾销税税率）根据第三条第一款和该条第二款但书征收反倾销税的，被征收货物的供应商的反倾销税税率如附表3所列。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1329,"end":1373,"target_id":"3b4e33aed1bbf7ea5f314cb7c626166fe77add6b135d174c7f4b63557893a043","source_hash":"1a76241e55f36007060c783440ae381f3494a06d16b0a9cb89e9144cb2b2c27c","text":"补充规定 <第1126号，2025年5月16日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1373,"end":1407,"target_id":"b6943e0632c8f63fd6ba2439e9d1dd4c74dfc23e0a143b0df29a65641b18e091","source_hash":"dae8c8e17eb08bab91e7215d365f8f767381222570c1fff80c0b13cdd50d3b3f","text":"增补（财政经济部组织实施细则）<2026年1月2日第1号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1407,"end":1443,"target_id":"6e6f60db9c09b6c9c18537e2d60cd1636ae67d1267ad0cb96b4dc4d932c7f53f","source_hash":"2ab9a5a4ab19c7e3d112445e12139428572301c0cc51eb3ab45600d4f7b77d64","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2026年1月2日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1443,"end":1457,"target_id":"a099cd72fe738b254ef06d0f3ef5073078f1e664890faf9cb48a40834760ccfd","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1457,"end":3227,"target_id":"4f4f4b7c2eaa300663d3437e8e6b435e8255d10ceae1c0fc68f1db12ca75a615","source_hash":"c700419994c7a74cabb3a986ace300a467c1a11173a42ee8aaa1af8fe1a6c171","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<50>款已省略\n\n  <51> 对来自中国、印度尼西亚和台湾的扁平轧制不锈钢征收反倾销税的规定修改如下。\n\n  在第三条第二款正文中，“战略与财政部长”应改为“财政与经济部长”。\n\n  <52> 至 <56> 已省略\n\n免征反倾销税的商品（与第2条但书有关）\n■ 对来自中国、印度尼西亚和台湾的扁平轧制不锈钢征收反倾销税            \n\n  的规则 [附录 1]                                                                        \n\n  免征反倾销税的商品（与第2条但书有关）                                  \n\n  1. S312             \n\n  54、S31803、S32050、S32205、S32750 和 N08367                 \n\n  2. 镍基（指含镍的，包括含镍和其他元素的）             \n\n  ），镍含量低于总重量的6%，锰含量为                 \n\n  200系列产品，含量3%及以上（根据《海关法实施令》第98条第1款规定的海关和统计综合项目）               \n\n  分类表中的项目编号为 7219.12.1010、7219.13.1010、7219.14.1010 和 7219.22。        \n\n  编号 1010、编号 7219.23.1010、编号 7219.24.1010、编号 7219.31.1010、编号 7219.32.1010、编号 721     \n\n  编号 9.33.1010、编号 7219.34.1010、编号 7219.35.1010、编号 7219.90.1010、编号 7220.11.1010、编号   \n\n  （对应于 7220.12.1010、7220.20.1010 或 7220.90.1010）            \n\n  3. 宽度为2000毫米及以上的热轧产品                                                \n\n  4. 符合美国材料与试验协会 (ASTM) 标准的 316 或 316L 钢材，厚度为 3.0 mm             \n\n  长度为 1,524 毫米及以上且厚度为 4.0 毫米及以下的热轧产品                    \n\n  5. 符合中国国家标准（GB：国标）的2Cr13、3Cr13、4Cr13和6Cr13钢种             \n\n  厚度不超过 3 毫米，宽度不超过 400 毫米，硬度不超过 250HV 35               \n\n  产品电压为 0HV 或更低                                                                           \n\n  6. 满足以下各项所有要求的产品                                                     \n\n    A. 硅含量应为总重量的0.3%以上且0.6%以下。                                  \n\n    B. 锰含量应为总重量的0.9%以上且1.3%以下。                                  \n\n"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00001","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883454","source_hash":"41cd2f1a3bbf0b2979792665d8bf3fc430d767f50ef55445261a9b20a43c7dd2","text":"■ 对来自中国、印度尼西亚和台湾的扁平轧制不锈钢征收反倾销税"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00002","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883455","source_hash":"ccce9ddb1bf9c9c32f3ad6833a36eada3847d78a382f0d8be49133d89d68bd83","text":"的规则 [附录 1]"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00003","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883456","source_hash":"90c5c7147a0135ab9d1b4789549220eccc0a5f5c8701e18baa9cd536b4701e44","text":"免征反倾销税的商品（与第2条但书有关）"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00004","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883457","source_hash":"751baf3c09a7c4dc5948f08f201181b10a2c7f6fd4c6e930b9d529faeb1a697a","text":"1。根据美国材料与试验协会 (ASTM) 标准，S312"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00005","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883458","source_hash":"8ba1043debd9f5f18c93950229ca4ebb1d16393b815f8c43878ddd9cf8673557","text":"54、S31803、S32050、S32205、S32750和N08367"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00006","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883459","source_hash":"f012eb9904f18d5fb12ad050d74c731b7ccafa6143372032ac9e1f3a6ad5a45f","text":"2. 镍基（指含镍的，包括含镍和其他元素的）"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00007","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883460","source_hash":"1f3177a45177eb490a4cf4f4849c748226ac4c113d5d493b02c63f251f113233","text":")，镍含量低于总重量的6%，锰含量为"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00008","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883461","source_hash":"d6db5b44695f401624eb5e3f8b480318bba854b6bef0d81c77698f129651cfdf","text":"200系列产品，含量3%及以上（根据《海关法实施令》第98条第1款规定的海关和统计综合项目）"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00009","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883462","source_hash":"ee1173eb1cc8875e15b04067a84657a03d98578d2ac2280ecfca1414161e8e0e","text":"分类表中的项目编号为 7219.12.1010、7219.13.1010、7219.14.1010、7219.22."},{"id":"A39837-zh-00010","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883463","source_hash":"7c24dfad74c066598e6a0b4f99810d52577019b7c21e84a16185422548e7d4ed","text":"1010，编号 7219.23.1010，编号 7219.24.1010，编号 7219.31.1010，编号 7219.32.1010，编号 721"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00011","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883464","source_hash":"24d95d617eb43fbbf614f06cb51627393f7f4d2fb1921293cfd68770f4a9d44d","text":"9.33.1010，编号 7219.34.1010，编号 7219.35.1010，编号 7219.90.1010，编号 7220.11.1010，编号"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00012","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883465","source_hash":"9eb56825f1549003008f77ff70fa39695e009dfb4071a6125019bb61164015f7","text":"（参见税号 7220.12.1010、7220.20.1010 或 7220.90.1010）"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00013","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883466","source_hash":"baaa709f21cdd0e597340bdf1465137ad12e92809e4f402caed1731f08be9672","text":"3. 宽度为2000毫米或以上的热轧产品"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00014","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883467","source_hash":"0e2e7449f7a4b0fcef996d5f24bb3162d0dc27c27f387f8804f751ef4203c271","text":"4. 根据美国材料与试验协会 (ASTM) 标准，钢材牌号对应于 316 或 316L，厚度为 3.0 毫米。"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00015","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883468","source_hash":"0c777e03fb2a50844a3367cb783c27a7d2c29393daccf63359faed877c24d03b","text":"厚度为 1,524 毫米及以上且 4.0 毫米及以下的轧制热轧产品"},{"id":"A39837-zh-00016","doc":"A39837","law_id":"kr-014886-282691-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2883469","source_hash":"b8967455111d50